  "question": "Let $P=\\left(\\frac1{\\sqrt2},\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\right)$ and $Q=\\left(-\\frac1{\\sqrt2},-\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\right)$ be two vertices of a regular polygon having 12 sides such that $PQ$ is a diameter of the circle circumscribing the polygon. Which of the following points is not a vertex of this polygon?",
